Design notes:
- `ViewCount` and `LastViewedAt` live only on the entity. Requests bind to `TicketRequest`, which has no such fields, so clients cannot set them. The server increments them on each `GET /{id}`.
- `POST` returns 201 with a `Location` header. `PUT` returns 200 with the updated ticket, and `DELETE` returns 204. Unknown ids return 404 for all three.
- A blank `subject` or `category` returns 400. Missing `priority` or `escalated` values default to `0` and `false`.
